      "summary": "<p><g-emoji class=\"g-emoji\" alias=\"warning\">⚠️</g-emoji> <strong>Warning:</strong> The keyboard handling has changed as of v3.67.0 and later. If you after upgrading to this version ever revert to a version prior to v3.67.0, you <strong>will lose your keyboard bindings</strong>. Also there's an issue with migrating certain shortcuts with some keyboard layouts to the new version. See <a href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2671#issuecomment-3727638311\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2671/hovercard\">TLDR here.</a></p> <ul> <li>Improve UI and accessibility <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3484701906\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2561\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2561/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2561\">#2561</a> (remove abandoned <a href=\"https://github.com/segmentio/evergreen\">evergreen-ui</a> and reduce usage of sweetalert)</li> <li>Use <kbd>Shift</kbd> + mouse click/drag to move/resize segments (configurable modifier key) <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"751932541\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/517\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/517/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/517\">#517</a> #2595 <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"725460235\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/483\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/483/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/483\">#483</a></li> <li>Use native web keyboard events (<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/UI_Events/Keyboard_event_code_values\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>KeyboardEvent.code</code></a>): This makes keybindings consistently independent of keyboard layout. Also don't trigger hotkeys when some UI element or dialog is focused.</li> <li>New action <code>play-selected-segments</code> (once) <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3483622596\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2557\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2557/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2557\">#2557</a></li> <li>Implement file name template also for merge files <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2974131287\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2403\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2403/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2403\">#2403</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3172655145\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2489\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2489/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2489\">#2489</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2368533601\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2054\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2054/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mifi/lossless-cut/issues/2054\">#2054</a> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2970908224\" data-permi